      "text_unit_id": "tu_0003",
      "verbatim_text": "3. In patients with NICM who survive a cardiac arrest, have sustained VT, or have symptomatic VA who are ineligible for an ICD (due to a limited life-expectancy and/or functional status or lack of access to an ICD), amiodarone may be considered for prevention of SCD (S7.2.1-12,S7.2.1-13)."
